.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcpy()
function copies the string pointed to by
.I src
(including the terminating null byte) into the buffer pointed to by
.IR dest .
The caller must ensure
.I dest
is large enough.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters copied, not including the null byte.
